   R = dξ/dt = d(C0 S^m)/dt = C0 m S^{m-1} (dS/dt)
   Define R1 := m S^{m-1} (dS/dt) so that R = C0 R1

4. Substitute ξ_op, ξ_bd and R into the TF expression:
   TF(F%) = (1/(n+1)) [ (C0 S_op^m) / (C0 R1) ] [ (C0 S_bd^m) / (C0 S_op^m) ]^{n+1}

5. Cancel common factor C0 in numerator and denominator:
   TF(F%) = (1/(n+1)) [ S_op^m / R1 ] [ (S_bd^m / S_op^m) ]^{n+1}

